cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "tool-market: a protocol-driven resource substrate for evolvable agent tools"
abstract: "FastAPI/Pydantic/SQLite service in which each tool is a stateful, versioned, lineage-carrying resource. Two orthogonal state axes decouple may-this-run from which-revision-is-live; an append-only SHA-256 hash chain makes the audit trail tamper-evident."
authors:
